pan style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;color:rgb(102,0,102)\">★3組彩：</span>獎號中有二個號碼相同者，例如112。 <br><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;color:rgb(102,0,102)\">★6組彩：</span>獎號的三個號碼皆不相同，例如123。<br>* 註：組彩不接受三位相同數字，如&quot;111&quot;之投注。</li><li style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 18px;border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;list-style:none;background:url(https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/jff3FNJR2vm-x28u9ZwUjrVyJ-DKasBSCbHUurpWC5fKT-KH2YMG6y-46WkXeIXN-PVvd9q3DZI8yC1Ng7_Sx8Kywt23NNZU4A=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.taiwanlottery.com.tw/images/icon_htx_03.jpg) 0px 7px no-repeat\">對彩： <br>如您選擇此玩法，且您的三位數選號中，前二位數或後二位數與獎號完全相同，順序亦同，即為中獎。</li></ul></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
